    "---\n",
    "## Section 2: Non-Linear Peer Distance\n",
    "\n",
    "The original v1 uses **Pearson correlation** for peer similarity. This version uses:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Spearman rank correlation** — captures monotonic non-linear relationships\n",
    "2. **Distance correlation** — captures general dependence (linear + non-linear)\n",
    "3. **Volatility similarity** — same as v1\n",
    "4. **Downside similarity** — using Spearman for tail dependence\n",
    "\n",
    "The composite distance is: `0.30 × Spearman + 0.20 × DistCorr + 0.15 × Vol + 0.15 × Downside`"
   ]
