    "---\n",
    "## Summary & Conclusions\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Findings\n",
    "\n",
    "| Aspect | Finding |\n",
    "|--------|--------|\n",
    "| **Best Non-Linear Method** | Depends on the stock — RF and GBR generally perform well |\n",
    "| **vs Linear (v1)** | Non-linear methods often capture tail dependence better |\n",
    "| **Ensemble** | Averaging multiple non-linear models reduces variance |\n",
    "| **Dynamic vs Static** | Dynamic helps for long windows, static for short |\n",
    "| **Feature-Based** | Rich features + RF outperforms raw correlation in volatile periods |\n",
    "\n",
    "### When to Use Each Method\n",
    "\n",
    "| Scenario | Recommended Method |\n",
    "|----------|-------------------|\n",
    "| Short distress (< 15d) | Static RF or Static GBR |\n",
    "| Long distress (≥ 20d) | Dynamic RF or Ensemble |\n",
    "| High volatility spike | SVR (RBF) — robust to outliers |\n",
    "| Regime change | Dynamic KNN — adapts locally |\n",
    "| Need interpretability | RF (feature importance available) |\n",
    "| Best overall accuracy | Ensemble Non-Linear (RF+GBR+SVR+KNN) |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Comparison with Linear Methods (v1)\n",
    "\n",
    "| Criterion | Linear (v1) | Non-Linear (v2) |\n",
    "|-----------|-------------|-----------------|\n",
    "| Peer relationships | Assumes linear additivity | Captures interactions |\n",
    "| Tail dependence | Limited by Pearson correlation | Spearman + DistCorr |\n",
    "| Regime adaptation | Static beta | Dynamic re-estimation |\n",
    "| Interpretability | Coefficients are clear | Feature importance (RF) |\n",
    "| Computational cost | Fast | Moderate (RF/GBR) to slow (SVR/MLP) |\n",
    "| Overfitting risk | Low (regularised) | Moderate (needs tuning) |"
   ]
